<title>Cabo Delgado, Mozambique: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/mozambique/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-mozambique-2026-11-12T13:00:27.470Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 13:00:27 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Militant Islamist insurgents in Cabo Delgado continue attacks, recently beheading six Christians and killing a Catholic priest after a baptism of 175 people. Security forces captured six alleged terrorists in Macomia and killed three robbers at a micro-credit service, showing actions beyond the insurgency. The United States warned of a growing ISIS threat to African maritime trade while abuses are undermining Mozambican counter-insurgency efforts, and oil prices rebounded after shipping attacks in the region. Flood releases from the Pongolapoort dam raise flood risk in Maputo province, and there were 151 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE5nUHJNZG5wNTNoTEJoeXYzWlhhNlIxcXFYclhQQVdKdkJ5d0ExWjBpR1NFRWpkSmQxeHd1dUNTYk1jaVpicXRFbi1za1p0WHhFWDJUNmlHbUlvM3NXTXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE1SdVpvLTl3Qi01N0RVTWxpRXZJdkg4ODlRa2NIRmZDWXlreTYzc3Fac3NMWTh2NFlwMS1POVlaTVVlUWVxbF9tUmI1OGxEQWdsektXdE1UQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMif0FVX3lxTE1palNuYW5FeWo4MUZDNDJJWVdDNXlPbDlMOVVQT3JWQzVodnlvRXk4QnJITmpyZ2R3M0x5c29SUFBYWUQtYm9xQ0hMV25uWTQ5d014dnhseFJBUm1LV2lOZ29kbnJZSXU4YldfM0VJUUM0SlVIMVozU0cyOGVnRDg?oc=5&quot;&gt;aimnews.org&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxQdHpTS2VGQl9Dam56NDhVSG92amp1MDNqX2d0YlFRTnUzZExLa2xrdkVaaHZBMVlBZHR4V3NWTDk4SHRNTVZpQlpIbW11RHVwc2ZOeDJRVE1UekxCUlY0eTItRk0tUTZzZ0Z0ZFdRWW1za3BaeFZUV2VqVm4tb2JGNWo2OHRQRGtkTmJ2UXVtT3p1X0trZ3BZTXNEZ0haWFRJYTJmaUln?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yeni Safak English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxPZ3FocE5HMjlSTi12VVYwNVphRFZSMHYweXlKSWZEb2huVnhSMVlyS1ctN0VteEJtQVo1dXI3SDI3NEowakdETl